Z||000000||Cozmo||04-13-2001||08:34 AM||||Had a friend drive one of my Fieros for the first time (BTW, she LOVED it!) and she offered to fill up the tank. It was funny watching her try to open the gas filler cap, I finally took pity and showed her where the release was.<BR>Got me to thinkin' about the FIRST time I tried to open one <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>Wonder if anyone has any good stories?<BR><P>------------------<BR><B>C02M0</B><BR><I>Suncoast Fieros</I><BR>'85 silver 2M6 4spd. Targa <B>"Silver Streak"</B><BR>'86 black auto GT <B>"Blackbird"</B><BR>'87 white auto Coupe <B>"The Duke"</B>||||reg||10
