Z||000010||JSocha||04-13-2001||02:09 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by onfire:<BR><B>That's nothing it took me 2 days to figure out where the sunroof went.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Where does it go?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P>(5 month old newbie, still crawlin but at least not walkin!)<P>Well, at least I knew where the gas cap release lever was located when I bought mine...in-tah-wishon? who knows!  Wife always informs me its a "Hubby's job to know these things"...guess I have to live up to her standards some how  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 04-13-2001).]||||reg||1
