Z||000015||JSocha||04-13-2001||11:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Rex:<BR><B>tore my jeans climbing over the E-Brake handle( didnt know it pushed back down in the locked position).</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Took me about a week to figure the same thing out.  During that time I certainly came up with a lot of colorful words and statements against GM Engineers  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>||||reg||1
Z||000016||FieroLisa||04-14-2001||12:46 AM||||The guy who bought my coupe called me the day after he bought it asking where the gas cap release was, said he'd been looking for it forever.<P>I can't remember how long it took me to figure out the sunroof thing, but I know it was a while. <P>And I still can't get my ebrake to work right!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Everyone else but me can, though!<P>||||reg||1
